  "description": "A standalone .NET client for the 3x-ui / x-ui panel REST API: cookie-session\n      auth with lazy login and 401 re-auth, inbound listing, per-client CRUD via\n      the Get-mutate-Update fallback (works on forks without addClient/delClient),\n      health probing, and protocol-aware connection-string builders\n      (vless/vmess/trojan/shadowsocks).",
